==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|fro|enveier}}, from {{inh|fr|LL.|inviāre}}, from {{inh|fr|la|via||road, path}}. Compare Spanish, Portuguese, Occitan, and Catalan {{m|ca|enviar}}, Italian {{m|it|inviare}}. The irregularity on future and conditional stem were influenced by with that of {{m|fr|voir}}.

